# Anchored to repo root (2026-08-02, was bare `config/`) — service-account
# credential files predate shared/config/ (Phase 7), but the unanchored
# pattern also matched shared/config/, silently blackholing any *new* file
# added there (already-tracked files like retailers.config.ts were
# unaffected, since .gitignore doesn't retroactively untrack committed
# files — this only bit new files, like denylisted-domains.ts here).
